# tell, reply and replay. In the temple (3001): Decimus (10), Quintus (25), Sleeper (asleep) and Smokegod (an
# immortal past LEVEL_IMMORTAL, who reaches the sleeping and the quiet). The mayor (3143) is made asleep in the
# temple, and a fido (3062) in the Temple Square. A tell to an awake mob crashes the C game (it reads the mob's
# connection, which it hasn't: #49), so none is here; tests/test_scenarios.py covers that.
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@connect quin
Quintus
psswrd
@return
@connect sleep
Sleeper
psswrd
@return
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@mob 3143 3001
@mob 3062 3005
@as dec
reply no one yet
tell
tell quintus
tell nobody hello
tell fido hello
tell mayor hello
tell quintus hello there
tell quin by a prefix
tell self talking to myself
reply myself again
@as quin
reply hello back
@as dec
reply and again
tell sleeper wake up
@as god
tell sleeper from a god
@as sleep
reply thanks, god
@as quin
sleep
reply in my sleep
@as dec
reply are you asleep?
@as quin
wake
@pulse 1
quiet
tell decimus I'm quiet
@as dec
tell quintus are you quiet?
@as god
tell quintus a god gets through
@as quin
quiet
deaf
@as dec
tell quintus are you deaf?
reply deaf too?
@as god
reply god to deaf
@as quin
deaf
afk
@as dec
tell quintus are you there?
tell quintus second
reply third, by reply
@as quin
afk
replay
replay
reply got them
@as god
tell quintus I'm off
quit
@as quin
reply gone?
